      "message": "Hi Whale, did you also use `uhid-virt` or `tokio_linux_uhid`? The current uhid is very basic without input output event, as we only need the presence of a uhid, but it would be good if you can modify that to serve your purpose, as I can see a lot of duplicate code otherwise. WDYT.",
