      "writtenOn": "2023-08-30T06:54:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry for incorrect information. It seem like `uhid-virt` do support output event.\n\nhttps://docs.rs/uhid-virt/latest/src/uhid_virt/uhid_device.rs.html#52.\n\nHi Ferderic\n\nCloud you use read function in `uhid-virt` directly?",
